---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-medium tracking-tighter sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl">About</h1>

    <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Jules O'Dea, a Frontend Developer based in Auckland. With a passion for
        creating responsive, user-friendly experiences, I help businesses deliver innovative,
        highly optimised web and mobile applications.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the past 6+ years, I've worked with global clients, combining technical
        excellence with a focus on solutions that deliver for both client and customer needs.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm proficient in JavaScript, TypeScript, React, HTML, CSS, SCSS, and Tailwind, and
        enjoy collaborating closely with designers and developers to bring ideas to life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
